Emphasize Component Composition. Almost always create a separate file with 1 component inside said file to package specific functionality of elements in screens, and then use said elements on screens instead of using lots of custom JSX.

If you think the component represents a 'screen' in the application, create it under the 'src/screens' directory

If you think the component will be reused accross the entire application, create it under the 'src/components' directory.

Do not use the index file pattern or barrel pattern. Import components directly from the file where they are defined. This reduces extra file complexity.
